OL,3,GNEWSAWoman arrested after passenger
OL,4,Adies in car crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 19-year-old woman has been arrested
OL,7,Fafter a car hit a tree, killing one of
OL,8,Fthe passengers.
OL,10,FThames Valley Police said the collision
OL,11,Fhappened at about 02:20 BST on Thursday
OL,12,Fin High Wycombe, Buckinghamshire.
OL,14,FA red Ford Fiesta left the road near
OL,15,Fthe junction of Horns Lane and Lane End
OL,16,FRoad.
OL,18,FOne of the four occupants, a woman in
OL,19,Fher late teens, died at the scene.
